{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784190/extras/0d3a40cbaea92e3ea3fb4d45089e5b46.webp?t=1759244422\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the loveable, locked and loaded Metalhead! As Splintered Fate's first fully ranged character, he comes with a unique gameplay style to complement the Turtles. Fire his blasters, transform into a spinning missile frenzy, and lob landmines to stop enemies in their tracks. Metalhead has an affinity with our new (free!) Robotics Powers.\u00a0Fully playable in both the Main Campaign and the all-new Arcade Mode, Metalhead is ready to join you wherever you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784190/extras/bce7ce80e7936b5557c6e7e383e2ead7.poster.avif?t=1759244422\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784190/extras/bce7ce80e7936b5557c6e7e383e2ead7.webm?t=1759244422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784190/extras/bce7ce80e7936b5557c6e7e383e2ead7.mp4?t=1759244422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784190/extras/bb30919c6616f0af125bc85dd9725814.webp?t=1759244422\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 5 new Artifacts that can modify your run in interesting ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious Gofu - Grants a random Tool at the start of each Chapter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gigantic Tusk - You can't heal, but gain a bunch of extra Dragon Coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kitsune's Cup - You can't heal, but gain a bunch of extra Dreamer Coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cracked Stasis Beacon - You are slowed, but defeating a boss grants a huge supply of Scrap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clan Hamato Seal - gain an additional Splinter's Revive, and revive with more health</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784190/extras/5f8f118939a5b9352e6bbd3622f289d2.poster.avif?t=1759244422\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784190/extras/5f8f118939a5b9352e6bbd3622f289d2.webm?t=1759244422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784190/extras/5f8f118939a5b9352e6bbd3622f289d2.mp4?t=1759244422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784190?t=1759244422","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784190/a6825b4b9921c0df8bc6654fbbfb63514ae52a0b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759244422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784190/d705de42975b685545c46250a841c8ced050936f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759244422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784190/d705de42975b685545c46250a841c8ced050936f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759244422","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadabl